<title>POLAND: Amerbank cuts new issue price to PLN 20.</title>
<headline>Amerbank cuts new issue price to PLN 20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   Amerbank SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  common shares</p>
<p> Priced at (PLN):			20</p>
<p>No of Shares Offered: (Previous)  1.5 million  No of Existing Shares:		4.2 million</p>
<p> Lead Manager:			   Amerbrokers</p>
